# Cloudflare Turnstile CAPTCHA (Round 2 abuse protection)
# Site key is public — safe in the client bundle. Get both from
# dash.cloudflare.com -> Turnstile after creating a free site for
# highwaylot.com.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=

# Secret key is server-only. Set this in Vercel's project env vars
# (Project Settings -> Environment Variables), NOT in this file or
# anywhere with a VITE_ prefix — that would ship it to the browser.
# Listed here only as a reminder of the name api/verify-turnstile.js reads.
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=
